  [PASS] V5 changed text 'which is matched in initial conditions only and has no g': which is matched in initial conditions only and has no gas expulsion (∆χ2 = -10.08 canonical, -9.39 alternative; Correction v1.1)
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'KiDS cannot tell the capped cold sector from plain gravi': KiDS cannot tell the capped cold sector from plain gravity plus gas expulsion, and the result shows that the capped cold sector does not overproduce structure, not a preference for the law (Correction v1.1)
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'On the alternative footing DES Y3 is diagnostic and also': On the alternative footing DES Y3 is diagnostic and also CONSISTENT (-2.15), but plain gravity with the expulsion gives -2.17 (Correction v1.1)
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'Shear ∆χ2 sizes are set mainly by the lensing amplitude,': Shear ∆χ2 sizes are set mainly by the lensing amplitude, and no arm fits well in absolute terms (Correction v1.1)
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'The engine that produces the pass has no established phy': The engine that produces the pass has no established physical parent (PAPER57); per CFG963 that is not load-bearing for the shear result (Correction v1.1)
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'The control, NCS0, is the same pipeline with every modul': The control, NCS0, is the same pipeline with every module off (plain Poisson gravity) on the same initial conditions; it has no a0 , so it serves both footings, but it is matched in initial conditions only: it applies no gas expulsion, while NC1x and NC2x include the census gas expulsion M3 (CFG963; Correction v1.1)
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'Five caveats limit what this means; the first is new in ': Five caveats limit what this means; the first is new in v1.1 (Correction v1.1)
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'The lead over NCS0 is carried by gas expulsion (Correcti': The lead over NCS0 is carried by gas expulsion (Correction v1.1)
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'The CONSISTENT class holds against this fair control too': The CONSISTENT class holds against this fair control too, but KiDS cannot tell the capped cold sector from plain gravity plus gas expulsion
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'CFG963 traces the deficit to the gas expulsion: the M3 t': CFG963 traces the deficit to the gas expulsion: the M3 transfer alone is
  [PASS] V5 changed text 'at the same k (Correction v1.1)': at the same k (Correction v1.1)
